# quizgen has no required configuration — selection works out of the box.
#
# The only optional setting is the embedding model used for *semantic*
# deduplication (python -m quizgen ... --dedup --embeddings). Without the
# 'embeddings' extra installed, dedup uses a dependency-free token-overlap
# measure and this value is never read.

# EMBEDDING_MODEL=all-MiniLM-L6-v2
